  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1611.04 Wood Construction",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1611.04 Wood Construction. Indoor storage facilities constructed with wood shall have sides, bottoms and covers or doors constructed of 2 inch hardwood and shall be well braced at corners. They shall be covered with sheet metal of not less than number 20 gauge. Nails exposed to the interior of such facilities shall be counter-sunk.\n\nSource. #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
